# chess_pieces_yolov8n.onnx goes here
#
# The model is NOT committed to git (binary, ~6 MB).
# To obtain it:
#   1. Train YOLOv8n on a chess piece dataset (e.g. from Roboflow Universe)
#   2. Export: yolo export model=best.pt format=onnx imgsz=640 int8=True
#   3. Copy the resulting best.onnx to this directory and rename it:
#      chess_pieces_yolov8n.onnx
#
# A pre-trained model will be provided in the project releases.
